  "design": {
    "enemySide": "north",
    "tacticalIdentity": "A first battle over the Vltava: hold the Old Town bank while columns come down from Mala Strana over Charles Bridge, the modern road bridge and the Kampa channel. Fuel drums, collapsing houses, hovercraft and a lone howitzer show what the battlefield can do.",
